    "Name": "FarmerMax",
    "Details": "The FarmerMax FM-2 mounts a combine in each arm for harvesting crops, a sprayer in each side torso connected to a five ton liquid storage bay, while a flamer in the head handles controlled burns and brush clearing.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.82</color></b>",
