  "StockRole": "Industrial Mech",
  "YangsThoughts": "The FarmerMax started out as a quadrupedal design, but MaxTech ran into gyro and stability problems in that configuration and converted it into a bipedal machine instead. Built as an all-in-one farming solution, it combines harvesting, irrigation and land clearing into a single unit, making it valuable enough to replace multiple pieces of separate equipment. Its 11 tons of industrial armor rarely see much use given the low-risk nature of agricultural work, though they've occasionally helped it survive when caught up in conflict.",
